@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #476050
skinparam dpi 140
hide methods
hide circle
title Allpatek | MySQL - Evidence
left to right direction
entity "evidences" as evidence {
  {field} * id: VARCHAR(160) <<PK>>
  --
  {field} * parcel_id: VARCHAR(160)
  {field} * milestone: INT
  {field} * status: ENUM
  {field} notes: TEXT
  {field} file_name: VARCHAR(240)
  {field} image: LONGTEXT
  {field} * created_at: DATETIME(6)
  {field} * updated_at: DATETIME(6)
}
entity "parcels" as parcel #EAF2EB {
  {field} * id: VARCHAR(160) <<PK>>
}
parcel ||..o{ evidence : parcel_id
note bottom of evidence
  The physical naming strategy pluralizes evidence to evidences.
  The REST resource is /api/v1/evidence.
  status = review, verified or accepted.
  The domain checks milestone 1 to 4; this column is an integer.
  Climate readings are calculated on request.
end note
legend bottom
PK = primary key     * = NOT NULL
Crow's feet describe logical cardinalities. The schema declares no foreign keys for these IDs.
endlegend
@enduml
